  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cash Assistance to Refugees - Elleniko Camp, Athens</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide multi-purpose prepaid cash cards for refugees based in Elleniko Camp, near Athens. For the initial support of 50,000 GPB proposed, CAFOD will provide support to an estimated 135 families and 192 individuals, which would represent 36% of the total transfer in support of the entire camp at Elleniko. A blanket approach to cash programming is being used.  Further payments may be made on review of the first month of support.</narrative>
  </description>
